# A database in the tree is the one mistake there is no taking back once it is
# pushed. The real one lives wherever dbPath points, and the throwaway used for
# the screenshot is built outside the repo -- neither belongs in here.
*.kdbx
*.key
*.keyx

# Stale editor and rescue copies. A .bak of a panel is a second, older copy of
# the plugin sitting in the tree, and the shell can be told to load it.
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.orig
*.rej
*~

*.local.*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
